    "A control can be counted in more than one state. Element records also include containers and collections. Observations do not count successful tasks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A control can be counted in more than one state. Element records also include containers and collections. Observations do not count successful tasks."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uno stesso controllo può essere contato in più stati. Gli elementi includono anche contenitori e collezioni. Le osservazioni non contano i compiti riusciti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A relationship links an action to an observed result. Matching and conflicting results count distinct tool calls, not completed tasks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A relationship links an action to an observed result. Matching and conflicting results count distinct tool calls, not completed tasks."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una relazione collega un’azione al risultato osservato. Gli esiti coerenti o in contrasto contano chiamate distinte allo strumento, non compiti completati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A saved interface state. Its number identifies it in this view; it is not a procedure step.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
